> On Tue, Sep 07, 2010 at 09:59:51PM -0600, Alan Post wrote:
> > My favorite change so far is the following:
> > 
> > [-forbidden.-] {+forbilien .+}
> > 
> > Someone changed forbidden to forbilien, twice no less.
